        '空壳公司','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'空壳公司明确设立是为了建立不透明的所有权结构，如名义董事和虚构股东，旨在掩盖实益所有权并掩盖资金的犯罪来源。这是使用壳实体的主要战略目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"02 隐蔽机制","row":2}],"techniqueSheetRow":2},"tacticCodes":["CONCEALMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
