        '链跳','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'跳链是指反复跨多个区块链转移加密资产，引入新代币或稳定币，以增加交易链的复杂性，并掩盖非法资金的来源。这种层叠策略加剧了追踪资金至犯罪来源的难度。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":6}],"techniqueSheetRow":11},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
