        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0005','跨链桥将交易历史分割到多个区块链之间，增加了复杂性，掩盖了非法资金的来源。这与叠加阶段相符，通过将收益与来源区分开来，阻碍调查人员追踪资产的能力。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":8}],"techniqueSheetRow":13},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
