        '多重发票','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0008','犯罪分子利用重复或重复开票，在正常贸易融资流程下生成多条交易记录。这会掩盖审计线索，并使非法收益与犯罪来源保持距离。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":12}],"techniqueSheetRow":18},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
