        '交易定价被夸大','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0008','通过夸大成本和虚高发票，犯罪分子将非法资金嵌入看似合法的贸易或采购费用中，掩盖了与非法来源的直接联系。这种对发票定价的控主要作为分层策略，制造复杂的交易轨迹，阻碍非法收益的侦测和追踪。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":13}],"techniqueSheetRow":19},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
