        '贸易开票错误','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0008','贸易虚假发票利用伪造发票和文件，制造多层次的跨境交易，掩盖了将非法资金与犯罪来源联系起来的资金轨迹。通过故意制造交易价值和数量的错误，犯罪分子使调查人员更难追踪资金的真实来源。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":14}],"techniqueSheetRow":20},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
