        '高现金流房地产','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0010','犯罪分子通过创收性房产将非法资金引入合法运营收入，将其永久纳入正规金融体系。这种技术有效地将洗钱资本归为合法收入，降低了被发现的风险。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":4}],"techniqueSheetRow":24},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
