        '国际房地产','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0010','通过将非法资本投资于外国房地产，犯罪分子将洗钱资金藏匿在合法地产收购的幌子下，实际上将其融入合法经济体系。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":5}],"techniqueSheetRow":25},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
