        '租金收入计划','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0010','通过将非法资金转入租金账户并标注为合法租金支付，犯罪分子实际上完成了洗钱过程，使非法所得看起来像普通的财产收入。这条稳定且可信的收入来源与合法收入无异，完成了洗钱的最后阶段。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":6}],"techniqueSheetRow":26},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
