        '受监管交易骡子交易','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0011','犯罪分子反复通过多个受监管的交易所骡子账户转移非法资金，通常使用伪造的KYC文件。这些交易故意掩盖非法来源，形成复杂的审计追踪，使资金与犯罪来源保持距离。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":16}],"techniqueSheetRow":30},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
