        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0011','犯罪分子利用某些加密ATM运营商几乎没有或根本不存在的反洗钱/身份验证，作为进入加密生态系统的便捷切入点，绕过标准的尽职调查，快速进入监管较少的渠道。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":4},{"sheet":"04 放置","row":4},{"sheet":"05 离析","row":17}],"techniqueSheetRow":31},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION","PLACEMENT","LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
