        '赌场骡子网络','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0011','非法资金通过赌场交易被引入，购买筹码、进行少量投注，并迅速兑换，从而秘密将犯罪收益注入金融系统。将存款分散到多个“骡子”和阈值之间，避免触发标准的现金报告要求，这也是该技术的主要目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":5}],"techniqueSheetRow":32},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
