        '行业特定文件作','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0012','犯罪分子会伪造、针对行业的合规文件，以明显掩盖实益所有权和非法活动，背后是官方监管框架。这种手法掩盖了非法资金或行动的真实本质和来源。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"02 隐蔽机制","row":9}],"techniqueSheetRow":36},"tacticCodes":["CONCEALMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
