        '无许可MSB','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0013','无证MSB使犯罪分子能够绕过标准许可和KYC要求，提供一个直接或监管较少的渠道来交换或汇款非法资金。这降低了进入金融系统的门槛，使其成为资金快速、低调流动的主要战略目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":6}],"techniqueSheetRow":38},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
