        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0014','通过购买或经营农田、畜牧或农业企业，犯罪分子系统性地将非法资金与合法农业收入混合，实际上将非法所得当作合法收入。土地估价的复杂性、周期性的收入模式以及潜在的政府激励措施进一步使这些资金合法化，从而实现最终融入合法经济体系。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":12}],"techniqueSheetRow":48},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
