        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0014','通过伪造或纵官方报税表，犯罪分子将非法收入转化为看似合法的收入或免税收益。这使得他们能够将这些资金完全整合进合法的金融渠道，而几乎没有反洗钱的怀疑。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":15}],"techniqueSheetRow":51},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
