        '虚拟专用网络','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0015','VPN使用加密和代理路由来隐藏犯罪分子的真实位置和身份，使金融机构更难发现、调查或将可疑交易与他们关联起来。使用VPN的主要战略目标是持续规避反洗钱审查，维护运营安全。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":5}],"techniqueSheetRow":53},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
