        '公共WiFi网络','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0015','犯罪分子利用公共WiFi热点隐藏用户身份和位置，破坏基于IP的反洗钱控制，使数字取证变得复杂化。通过与同一网络上的多个临时用户融合，他们显著降低归因风险，主要与规避和运营安全目标保持一致。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":7}],"techniqueSheetRow":55},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
