        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0015','Onion over VPN 采用多层加密和路由方法，明确阻碍执法部门或反洗钱团队通过隐藏起讫点追踪非法资金流向的能力。这种更高的匿名性和多路由点增强了作隐秘性，使得调查或归因交易变得更加困难。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":9}],"techniqueSheetRow":57},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
