        '布谷小精灵','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0016','犯罪分子通过将非法资金与预期的合法汇款混入银行账户，借由常规入账的幌子将犯罪收益引入金融系统。这就是布谷鸟小号的主要目的。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":11}],"techniqueSheetRow":60},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
