        'ATM结构','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0016','频繁的、低于门槛的ATM存款系统性地将非法现金引入金融系统，有效地完成了犯罪资金的初步渗透，同时降低了被发现的即时风险。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":13}],"techniqueSheetRow":62},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
