        '小号','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0016','小号行为是将大量非法资金拆分成多个明确低于报告门槛的小额交易。这种策略有助于犯罪资金首次进入合法金融系统，同时降低了被发现的风险。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":14}],"techniqueSheetRow":63},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
