        '网络赌博','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子反复将非法收益小额存入在线赌博账户，并与合法赌注混合。随后，他们会将这些资金转移到多个账户和司法管辖区，明确目的是掩盖资金来源并增加侦查难度。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":22}],"techniqueSheetRow":64},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
