        '慈善与非营利组织','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子利用慈善或非营利的幌子，将非法资金与合法捐款混为一谈，实际上将所得伪装为合法的慈善捐款，并将其完全融入合法金融体系。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":17}],"techniqueSheetRow":66},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
