        '教育机构计划','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0019','非营利教育机构将非法收益与合法学费、奖学金或资助收入混入，有效地将受污染资金引入合法资金流，并掩盖其犯罪来源。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":18}],"techniqueSheetRow":67},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
