        '远程采矿','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0020','犯罪分子用非法资金支付远程挖矿服务费用，获得新生成的硬币，这些币看起来与原始黑钱无关。这种设置增加了额外的层次，掩盖了交易轨迹，并使所得与犯罪来源保持距离。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":25}],"techniqueSheetRow":69},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
