        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0023','犯罪分子利用伪造、篡改或被盗的身份证件规避KYC和CDD检查，从而能够以虚假或冒充身份开设或维护账户。这通过绕过标准尽职调查控制，在入职阶段有效隐藏了金融服务的真实身份，从而非法获得金融服务。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":11}],"techniqueSheetRow":73},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
