        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0024','通过CBI/RBI项目获得新护照或居留权，犯罪分子可以明确规避与真实背景相关的更严格的KYC检查。出示表面上合法的文件可以降低开户或跨境交易时的审查，从而简化以替代合法身份进入金融系统的流程。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":14}],"techniqueSheetRow":76},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
