        '体育俱乐部投资','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'通过投资或收购体育俱乐部，犯罪分子将非法收益转化为看似合法的收益或所有权，将犯罪资金与体育俱乐部知名的商业运营合并，品牌为体育俱乐部。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":19}],"techniqueSheetRow":77},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
