        '自动化事务系统','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'通过频繁的自动转账跨多个账户和货币，犯罪分子构建复杂的交易链，旨在掩盖非法资金来源并阻碍简单的审计。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":27},{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":11}],"techniqueSheetRow":78},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING","OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
