        '职业特权的利用','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子利用律师和会计师的保密义务来保护非法资金的真正所有者。通过通过专业信托账户引导交易，并营造绝对特权的感知，他们确保实益所有权被隐藏，实现隐藏非法收益来源的核心目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"02 隐蔽机制","row":10}],"techniqueSheetRow":85},"tacticCodes":["CONCEALMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
