        '自托管加密货币钱包','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'自架钱包让犯罪分子能够直接在受监管平台之外保管非法资金，从而绕过集中式的KYC和冻结措施。这阻碍了调查人员追踪或阻止交易的能力。其主要目标是确保外部监督最小化，并最大化非法收益的匿名性。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":12}],"techniqueSheetRow":86},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
