        '隐私钱包','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0034','隐私钱包采用先进的匿名功能，通过隐藏交易细节和所有权数据阻碍执法，明确使犯罪分子能够绕过反洗钱检查和调查审查。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":13}],"techniqueSheetRow":87},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
