        '商业投资','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'通过将非法收益作为资本或股权注入合法企业，犯罪分子将受污染的资金嵌入合法商业中。这一过程使最终回报看起来像普通利润，实际上将非法资产与合法收入流合并。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":22}],"techniqueSheetRow":89},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
