        '循环交易','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'通过多次循环（或称“旋转木马”）在多个账户和司法管辖区间的转账，犯罪分子故意通过破坏审计线索和隐藏实益所有权来掩盖非法资金来源，从而实现了经典的分层目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":32}],"techniqueSheetRow":92},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
