        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0040','通过将汇款标记为礼物、家庭支持或慈善捐赠，犯罪分子绕过了标准的反洗钱触发和查询，有效地确保了汇款渠道的进入或持续使用，且对非法资金的审查极少。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":17}],"techniqueSheetRow":94},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
