        '资产估值作','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'反复的高估或低估购买和转售会模糊所有权，使非法来源的追踪更加复杂，从而在最终整合步骤之外提供了独特的层次维度。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":35},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":24}],"techniqueSheetRow":99},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING","INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
