VALUES ('AMLTRIX-TECH-T0045.001',1,NULL,'AMLTRIX_TECHNIQUE','T0045.001',
        '珠宝估价作','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0045','犯罪分子利用珠宝的主观性和可携带性，反复在多个司法管辖区间交易和转售物品，形成不透明的交易链，使非法资金与其犯罪来源保持距离。通过在每次交易中抬高或低报价值，这种技术主要支持叠加，以掩盖资金的原始来源。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":36}],"techniqueSheetRow":100},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
