        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0045','犯罪分子策划多次拍卖交易，利用纵的收藏品估值，专门掩盖并切断非法资金与犯罪来源的联系。他们在某些场所利用最低限度的反洗钱监管，制造复杂的资金流向，从而阻碍侦查。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":37}],"techniqueSheetRow":101},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
