        '钻石走私','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0048','通过反复跨境运输钻石、虚报货物并在不同司法管辖区转售，犯罪分子制造了多重交易层面，掩盖了非法收益与其犯罪来源之间的直接联系。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":40}],"techniqueSheetRow":106},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
