        '贵重商品走私','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0048','通过用非法资金购买贵金属或宝石并实地跨境走私，犯罪分子通过多重交易步骤掩盖非法资金来源，规避传统金融监管。该技术的核心战略目的是复杂化审计追踪，使资产与其犯罪来源保持距离。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":41}],"techniqueSheetRow":108},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
