        '勒索软件支付','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0049','通过勒索软件勒索，犯罪分子强行从受害者支付中获取非法资本，这正是他们获取非法收益的核心目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":5}],"techniqueSheetRow":110},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
