        '保护费','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0049','通过保护费，犯罪分子通过敲诈勒索获得稳定的非法收益。主要目标是通过强制收费定期获取非法收入，然后必须洗钱以避免被查获。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":6}],"techniqueSheetRow":111},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
