        '财务记录的作','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子伪造或篡改财务报表和会计记录，制造误导性记录，明确掩盖非法资金与其真实来源之间的联系。这种复杂性使调查人员难以追溯收益来源，从而实现了一个明确的分层目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":42},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":27}],"techniqueSheetRow":112},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING","INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
