        '应计处理','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0050','通过人为调整费用或收入的时间和分类，权责发生制纵掩盖了报告企业盈利中的非法流入。这种渐进的混合有效地将受污染资金嵌入合法收入流中，与洗钱的整合阶段相符。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":28}],"techniqueSheetRow":113},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
