        NULL,'犯罪分子将非法现金存入中，以小额分销到多个分支机构或机构，将收益引入金融系统，同时通过基于门槛的报告和局部审查规避侦查。这种手法构成了对非法资金的早期渗透。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":15}],"techniqueSheetRow":118},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
