        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0061','CBI/RBI投资项目作为最终洗钱阶段，将犯罪资金嵌入合法的海外项目，如房地产或商业项目，并遵循官方认可的框架。这赋予了合法性的假象，使犯罪分子能够正式将非法资产纳入合法经济。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":35}],"techniqueSheetRow":133},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
