        '离岸预付和电子钱包发行','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0062','犯罪分子故意利用极少的KYC或伪造身份证开设离岸电子钱包或预付卡账户，绕过反洗钱管制，建立隐秘的金融入口。这是核心目标，因为它使他们能够从一开始就绕过标准的客户尽职调查要求。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":19},{"sheet":"05 离析","row":50}],"techniqueSheetRow":137},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION","LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
