        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0062','离岸赌博执照采用复杂且监管较宽的结构，使犯罪分子能够掩盖非法资金的来源、所有权和控制，实现隐藏的目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"02 隐蔽机制","row":15},{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":20},{"sheet":"05 离析","row":51}],"techniqueSheetRow":138},"tacticCodes":["CONCEALMENT","ACCESS_FACILITATION","LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
