        '基于NFT的价值混淆','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'通过基于NFT的价值控，犯罪分子将非法收益转化为数字艺术品或收藏品的表面合法利润。这些资金随后被转入传统银行账户或投资工具，完成洗钱的最后阶段，使资本看起来完全合法。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":37}],"techniqueSheetRow":141},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
