        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0065','在行李或货物中走私货币绕过了正式报告和海关检查，降低了被发现的风险，并将行动保密性作为首要目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":17}],"techniqueSheetRow":143},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
