        '高面额货币运输','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0065','犯罪分子会将高面额钞票（例如500欧元或1000瑞士法郎）实物运输跨境，以减少非法资金的实际体积。这降低了检查时被发现的可能性，并使收益能够秘密转移出正规银行渠道。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":18}],"techniqueSheetRow":144},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
