        '虚拟世界','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'在“虚拟世界”中，犯罪分子利用游戏或交易平台上的匿名账户，有效规避传统的反洗钱审查，比如使用与元宇宙NFT相关联的去中心化交易所。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":21},{"sheet":"04 放置","row":18},{"sheet":"05 离析","row":52},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":38}],"techniqueSheetRow":145},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION","PLACEMENT","LAYERING","INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
