        '基于元宇宙的资产转移','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0066','通过在去中心化交易所（DEX）上频繁的代币交换以及数字元宇宙资产（如虚拟房地产、NFT）的快速买卖，犯罪分子制造多笔复杂交易，故意掩盖资金的非法来源。这些快速交易和洗钱交易有助于将收益与其原始来源拉开距离。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":53}],"techniqueSheetRow":146},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
