        'DeFi 交易','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0067','通过通过DeFi协议——包括聚合器和流动性池——反复交换或质押多个区块链，犯罪分子制造出复杂的交易链，掩盖了原始非法资金。这种刻意的复杂性是分层的标志，它使所得资金与犯罪来源保持距离，并挫败了传统的反洗钱追踪方法。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":60}],"techniqueSheetRow":153},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
