        '交易链','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'交易链涉及跨多个账户、多个平台或区块链的反复转账。它通过快速的跨资产“链跳”和微交易，系统地将非法资金与其来源区分开来。这种复杂性明显阻碍了追踪资金流向的努力。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":65}],"techniqueSheetRow":159},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
