        '电汇转账链','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0070','电汇链涉及多次快速跨境或多银行交易，专门设计用来掩盖非法资金来源，阻碍追踪资金至犯罪来源的调查尝试。顺序转账会将和项分割或移动到多个账户之间，形成复杂的分层结构，从而阻碍检测。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":66}],"techniqueSheetRow":160},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
