        '贸易融资纵','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'通过伪造或夸大贸易文件、勾结的幌子实体以及多个跨境中介，犯罪分子创造出复杂的金融渠道，故意掩盖非法资金的来源和实益所有权，假借合法贸易融资交易的幌子。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":70},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":42}],"techniqueSheetRow":165},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING","INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
