        '汇票作','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0074','诈骗者利用伪造或夸大的文件策划复杂的跨境贸易交易和银行间转账。他们会在最终偿还前，添加多层掩饰，将非法收益与犯罪来源区分开来。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":71},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":43}],"techniqueSheetRow":166},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING","INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
