        '红绿条款信用状','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0074','犯罪分子通过虚假或伪造贸易文件，利用红绿条款信用证下的部分或预付款。将这些资金分散到多个司法管辖区和中介机构，带来了显著的交易复杂性，明确掩盖了收益的非法来源。这作为基于贸易的洗钱计划中的核心分层策略。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":72}],"techniqueSheetRow":167},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
