        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0086','通过交保单，犯罪分子获得了看似合法的保单退款或发放的赔偿，实际上将非法资金重新融入合法经济体系。这次最终赎回完成了洗钱的整合阶段。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":46}],"techniqueSheetRow":181},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
