        '保险年金','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子将非法收益转化为年金支付，借保险或退休金的名义将其嵌入合法经济中。这一最后阶段通过将洗钱资金呈现为常规的政策支出，巩固了其合法性。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":47}],"techniqueSheetRow":182},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
