        NULL,'实益所有权控系统性地改变或重新分配官方的所有权或受益人记录，创造不断变化的结构，掩盖最终控制者及其非法资产。其主要目标是掩盖实益所有权并复杂化调查。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"02 隐蔽机制","row":18}],"techniqueSheetRow":183},"tacticCodes":["CONCEALMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
