        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0088','轮换经纪账户持有人或授权交易者，包括名义控制员和假身份，明确掩盖了真实证券控制者的身份。这种做法阻碍了实益所有权的透明度和追踪工作。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"02 隐蔽机制","row":19}],"techniqueSheetRow":184},"tacticCodes":["CONCEALMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
