        '保险政策资金过多','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0090','犯罪分子反复超额投入资金，然后要求部分退还或提前退保，导致多笔交易掩盖资金的犯罪来源。提前撤资罚款被视为可接受的成本，明确实现分层目标，通过将非法收益与其来源划清界限。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":82}],"techniqueSheetRow":189},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
