        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0094','犯罪分子策划控性股票交易和跨多个账户或空壳实体的大批量交易，以掩盖非法资金的踪迹，形成一条复杂的链条，将所得与犯罪来源分开。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":85}],"techniqueSheetRow":194},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
