        NULL,'非正式协议绕过官方登记，省略监管文件，依靠隐秘手段来击败或延迟侦测行动。不进行KYC或合规检查，这成为逃避反洗钱管控和掩盖犯罪活动的主要手段。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":21}],"techniqueSheetRow":196},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
