        '贷款计划','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'通过将非法资金结构化为贷款收益或还款，犯罪分子实际上将其整合进合法的金融渠道。这完成了洗钱的最后阶段，并使资本被视为合法。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":50},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":51}],"techniqueSheetRow":200},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
