        '咨询公司计划','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0098','通过系统性地将非法收益与合法咨询收入混为一谈，犯罪分子将肮脏资金与普通商业收入合并，使其看起来合法，减少怀疑。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":52}],"techniqueSheetRow":201},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
