        '暗网市场交易','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'暗网市场交易利用基于Tor的匿名网络和假名加密货币来隐藏用户身份。这明确阻止了典型的反洗钱或执法部门的曝光，使犯罪分子能够逃避侦查。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"08 操作规避","row":22}],"techniqueSheetRow":203},"tacticCodes":["OPERATION_EVASION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
