        '忠诚点数','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子将非法收益转换为忠诚度或奖励积分，并跨多个账户或平台转移，使追踪资金的原始来源或流向变得更加困难。这明确作为一种分层策略，利用忠诚度项目中最低限度的反洗钱监管来掩盖资金流向。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":91},{"sheet":"07 资产保护","row":9}],"techniqueSheetRow":209},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING","ASSET_PROTECTION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
