        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0107','该手法涉及使用非法资金购买彩票，实际上将这些资金以购买彩票的名义作为合法交易引入金融系统。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":22},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":54}],"techniqueSheetRow":211},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT","INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
