        '芯片倾销','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0107','筹码倾销是指将非法资金分散或合并给多个玩家，利用串通投注来掩盖收益的来源和所有权。通过让转账看起来像是合法的赌博损失和赢利，犯罪分子制造了复杂的交易模式，阻碍了调查追踪。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":93}],"techniqueSheetRow":213},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
