        '比赛纵','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0107','通过控体育赛事的结果，犯罪分子保证了赢钱的赌注，将收入合法化为赌博收益，并将非法资金整合进合法的金融渠道。这一最终阶段的作通过为大量资金流入提供了可信的解释，掩盖了非法来源。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"06 整合","row":55}],"techniqueSheetRow":215},"tacticCodes":["INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
