        '赌场筹码转换','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0107','犯罪分子用非法现金兑换赌场筹码或信用点，借着合法赌博回报的名义将这些犯罪收益引入金融环境。这种非法资金的初始转换通过将其伪装成正常赌场交易的一部分，降低了即时被发现的风险。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":24}],"techniqueSheetRow":216},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
