        '提前退休金提取','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子通过伪造或伪造文件（如假医疗证明或困难申诉）来提前提取退休金资金，从而获得新的非法收益。这实际上是在欺骗退休计划，使他们以虚假借口释放资本。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":16}],"techniqueSheetRow":220},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
