        '可流通票据购买','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子用非法现金购买官方流通票据（如银行本票、旅行支票），作为初步渗透步骤，确保货币进入金融体系时比直接大额现金存款更不引起怀疑。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":25}],"techniqueSheetRow":221},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
