        '场外加密货币交易','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'犯罪分子利用场外交易台反复将非法资金转换并转入各种加密货币或账户，明确目的是掩盖资金来源和受益人。许多场外交易渠道的私密且监管极少，增加了交易复杂性，也使调查人员追踪资金的能力受挫。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":101}],"techniqueSheetRow":227},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
