        '多重货币兑换','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0115','犯罪分子通过各种平台反复将非法资金转换成多种货币——无论是法币还是加密货币——以掩盖资金来源。这种额外的复杂性是一种经典的叠加策略，使调查人员更难将资金与犯罪来源联系起来。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":103}],"techniqueSheetRow":229},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
