        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0115','多币种互换利用反复的跨货币转换，增加多重交易层面，明确掩盖非法资金的原始来源。这种复杂的交易序列是分层结构的核心，使执法部门追踪资金流向变得更加困难。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":104}],"techniqueSheetRow":230},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
