        '虚拟公司','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'虚拟公司依赖无形的公司结构、最低限度的实益所有权披露以及名义人安排来掩盖真实控制者和非法资金来源。主要目标是结构性地隐藏真正控制资产的人，从而阻碍简单的反洗钱查询。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"02 隐蔽机制","row":21}],"techniqueSheetRow":243},"tacticCodes":["CONCEALMENT"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
