        '无牌房地产经纪','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'无证经纪人通过规避受监管的反洗钱检查，帮助洗钱者进入房地产交易，有效规避了KYC和可疑活动报告要求。其主要目标是以最少的审查保障房产买卖渠道的安全。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":32}],"techniqueSheetRow":251},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
