        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0134','犯罪分子利用P2P渠道进行多次小额或快速的转账，跨多个用户账户和钱包，故意增加复杂性，掩盖非法收益的来源。主要目标是通过反复叠加步骤，将资金与犯罪来源区分开来。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"05 离析","row":117}],"techniqueSheetRow":253},"tacticCodes":["LAYERING"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
