        '未申报收益','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'未申报的收益通过将非法流入与正常收入混合进入合法金融渠道，然后存入个人或企业账户。这将犯罪收益伪装成普通营业收入，从而降低了立即被发现的风险。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"04 放置","row":30},{"sheet":"06 整合","row":61}],"techniqueSheetRow":257},"tacticCodes":["PLACEMENT","INTEGRATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
