        '社交媒体骡子招募','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0140','犯罪分子利用社交媒体招募无辜或共谋的“金钱骡子”，通过访问个人银行账户，规避典型的KYC和合规措施。这种策略主要为非法资金在金融体系中建立新的入口。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":36}],"techniqueSheetRow":261},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
