        '钓鱼骡子招募','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0140','钓鱼骡子招募主要旨在绕过标准的反洗钱管控，通过诱骗受害者泄露信息或开设账户，从而让犯罪分子直接利用这些账户转移非法资金。它利用信任和混乱来获取合法金融渠道的访问权限。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":37}],"techniqueSheetRow":262},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
