        '浪漫骡子招募','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0140','通过欺骗性的恋爱关系，招聘人员获得受害者自愿配合使用个人或商业账户，有效绕过了标准的KYC和反洗钱检查。这是主要战略目标，因为它为非法资金在更少监管动打开了新的渠道。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":38}],"techniqueSheetRow":263},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
