        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0140','犯罪分子以合法工作的名义，利用毫无戒心的新兵的个人银行账户。这使他们能够绕过标准的KYC措施，直接进入受监管的金融系统，且几乎没有受到严格审查。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"03 准入便利","row":39}],"techniqueSheetRow":264},"tacticCodes":["ACCESS_FACILITATION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
