        '前驱化学品采购','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0142','该技术涉及通过药品销售产生或收取非法收益，这些收益用于资助购买前体化学品和设备。这直接支持非法资金的获取，形成一个循环，将非法收入产生并再投资于更多犯罪活动。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":20}],"techniqueSheetRow":267},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
