        '欺诈','TECHNIQUE',
        NULL,'欺诈通过虚假发票、虚假索赔或伪造文件等欺骗手段直接产生新的非法收益，使其成为洗钱的核心犯罪依据。犯罪分子利用这些手段一开始就获取非法资金，将欺诈定位为可洗钱资金的初始来源。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":25}],"techniqueSheetRow":271},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
