        '预付费欺诈','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','预付费诈骗者以虚假的回报或奖品为借口，要求受害者预付款，直接从毫无戒心的受害者那里获得非法收益。这是该计划的主要目标。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":27}],"techniqueSheetRow":273},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
