        '地毯拉扯','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','犯罪分子以欺诈性借口（例如有潜力的ICO）启动或推广新的加密代币或项目，以非法获取投资者资金。这正是拉地毯的主要目的，施害者迅速从毫无防备的参与者那里积累资金，然后逃离现场。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":28}],"techniqueSheetRow":274},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
