        '政府救济计划欺诈','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','其主要目的是通过虚假借口（如使用伪造资格数据或盗用身份）欺诈性地获取政府救济款项，从而获得新的非法收益。犯罪分子专注于直接获取这些资金作为初始非法资本。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":29}],"techniqueSheetRow":275},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
