        '经济救济欺诈','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','犯罪分子以虚假借口利用经济救助项目，如使用伪造文件或虚假工资数据，以获取新产生的非法收益。这与他们通过欺诈性索赔获取非法资金的核心目标直接一致。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":30}],"techniqueSheetRow":276},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
