        '费用报告欺诈','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','费用报告欺诈是一种前置犯罪，通过提交虚假或虚高的费用申报，从组织中获取非法收益，从而以合法报销为名挪用公司资金。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":31}],"techniqueSheetRow":277},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
