        '旋转木马欺诈','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','犯罪分子通过不同空壳公司策划反复跨境交易同一商品或无形服务，向政府部门提交虚假或夸大的增值税退税申报。这系统性地直接从税收退税系统中产生新的非法收益。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":32}],"techniqueSheetRow":278},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
