        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','犯罪分子通过诈骗性失业救济申请，常使用被盗或伪造的身份，以获取新发放的政府资金作为非法收益。这种行为与通过前置欺诈犯罪获取非法资本直接相关。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":33}],"techniqueSheetRow":279},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
