        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0144','骗子制造虚假的浪漫或友好关系，诱骗受害者进行欺诈性加密投资。这种手法使骗子能够直接获得非法资金，受害者将大量资金存入诈骗账户或钱包。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":34}],"techniqueSheetRow":280},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
