        '股息剥离','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0147','通过股息剥离计划（包括cum-ex），犯罪分子通过在股息日期前掩盖股份所有权，人为地声称多项股息退税，从而直接从政府资金中获得非法收益。这一策略至关重要，因为该计划的主要目标是将非法退税作为犯罪利润。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":53}],"techniqueSheetRow":299},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
