        '出口高估','SUB_TECHNIQUE',
        'AMLTRIX-TECH-T0147','通过高估的出口发票，欺诈者声称虚高的税收退税或出口激励，从而产生全新的犯罪收益。这使得不合理的退税或补贴支付成为非法资金的主要来源。','{"sourceRef":{"source":"AMLTRIX workbooks","release":"2025-05-30","tacticWorkbookSha256":"c691d169f40afb66fb1182cf3bd69574690173db92f0b298c03e0bd6aa62b6a2","indicatorWorkbookSha256":"dbbac9f27449d3a7e642233cc3f9590d8bc3539a7053888e9f48c85ba040f8a3","tacticRows":[{"sheet":"01 非法获取","row":54}],"techniqueSheetRow":300},"tacticCodes":["ILLEGAL_ACQUISITION"],"applicationStatus":"KNOWLEDGE_REGISTERED","observabilityDisposition":"UNASSESSED"}'::jsonb,
